---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import HubHero from "../components/HubHero.astro";
// About / philosophy page. Soft brand presence — no product, no selling.
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — MoolResha"
  description="Why MoolResha leads with education: know more, compare better, choose for yourself."
>
  <HubHero
    eyebrow="About MoolResha"
    title="Closer to the Root."
    lede="MoolResha helps people become more informed clothing buyers."
    image="/images/about-hero.webp"
  />

  <section class="about container prose">
    <p>
      Most of us shop by feel and by label, but few of us are taught to read
      what a label actually says — or what it quietly leaves out. MoolResha
      exists to change that. We trace clothing back to its root: the material
      story, from source to fibre to yarn to fabric to the garment you wear, and
      through the life it lives with you.
    </p>

    <h2>What we believe</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Explain, don't hype. What's true beats what sells.</li>
      <li>
        Composition isn't quality. "100%" and "premium" are starting points,
        not conclusions.
      </li>
      <li>
        Trade-offs, not winners. The right fabric depends on your use, climate,
        and comfort.
      </li>
      <li>
        Useful even if you never buy from us. That independence is the trust
        we're building.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <blockquote>
      Know more. Compare better. Choose for yourself.
    </blockquote>

    <p><a href="/">&larr; Back home</a></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: var(--space-8) var(--space-10);
  }
  .about h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
  }
  .about ul {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }
  .about blockquote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    margin-block: var(--space-8);
  }
</style>
